        "Description": "Good afternoon 47.\r\rYour main target is Dr. Singh. A wealthy Doctor, and a &quot;Prince&quot; in the Queen Anne II. After you have killed the Hitmen in Vermont,  it appears that the 8 &quot;Viceroys&quot; were only Vice-leaders of the Group, who are outranked by the 4 Princes, that answer directly to the Owl.\r\rYour secondary target is Dixon, a bodyguard who has personally checked Dr. Singh into his room. We must eliminate him, to ensure that Singh didn&apos;t reveal any important information.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
